      "writtenOn": "2019-09-17T18:09:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This seems like a one-to-one mapping between Android.bp properties and tradefed configuration.  When designing features like this, consider what the test developer is trying to accomplish, and let them specify that using higher level concepts.  That allows us to modify the logic here and in tradefed in the future as the implementation changes without having to go back and edit every Android.bp file.",
